# Aladdin's hover (PlayerHover, $81:D86A), which no script runs: with
# HOVER_ON ($036E) set, holding the fourth action's button (R in the
# options these states have) while falling makes him hover ($81:D076,
# the jump to it at $81:D07F). HOVER_ON is poked to 1 after his start has
# cleared it.
# 1. The first level: a jump, R held through the fall and on till he
#    lands ($81:D8ED).
# 2. The first level: a jump, R held for 20 frames, then let go (on at
#    PlayerAirStart, $81:D8A8).
# 3. Level 6 (rand_pw2_1's first 18 lines, then a jump to the right): he
#    hovers down a wall to ground that hurts. Held into the wall he is
#    pushed out of it each frame and only PlayerOutOfWallsHurt's second
#    test sees the hurt ($81:DD14); with his x speed ($08F4) zeroed once
#    he is at the wall (x $016A) nothing pushes him, and the test right
#    after his fall, PlayerGroundHurtJump's, sees it ($81:DD47). Both
#    runs are made.
# 4. Level 5 (rand_stage_a1_s1's first 9 lines, then walking right off
#    the ledge): hovering down through the ground with behaviour bit 4
#    behind (at y $01DC) sets V_1A10 and V_1A12 ($81:D8BC).
# 5. Level 4 (rand_pw1_1's first 63 lines, where he falls to the right
#    past a ledge at x $0220, y $0170 and catches it): hovering down the
#    wall at x $021A, his probe $10 (x+10, y-16 in the hover's box) meets
#    the ledge at y $0180 ($81:D8E5, on at PlayerLedgeGrab).
load build/aladdin/states/level1.state
wait 10
poke $00036E 01
hold B 12
hold B+R 20
hold R 120
wait 30
